{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colony is gone. A fog rolled in and left nothing but silence.<br>Only you remain, a small mouse with a few fragile brothers hiding in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something strange about the bodies left behind\u2026<br>When you touch them, their souls break free. Some whisper guidance, others curse your name. Not all of them are kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nest of Dust</strong> is a story about loss, survival, and strange powers hidden in the walls of a house.<br>You are small, weak, and frightened \u2014 the last one left to protect your little brothers. The rest of your colony is gone, and all that remains are their husks\u2026 and the spirits waiting to be freed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hollow spaces of the house \u2014 the walls, the attic, the blocked-off places. Piece together what really happened, while protecting the last scraps of family you have left.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the forgotten spaces of a house from a mouse\u2019s view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities whispered to you by ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the dead, some helpful, some hateful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about loss, and the things that linger in quiet places.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025210?t=1758231327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025210?t=1758231327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025210/8a4456deef7fd61097e11d00524c2bd278914974/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758231327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025210/8a4456deef7fd61097e11d00524c2bd278914974/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758231327","categories":[